### Ingest GitHub repo (commits + pulls + issues)
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/github/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "octocat",
  "repo": "Hello-World",
  "type": "all",
  "limit": 10,
  "state": "all"
}

###

### Ingest commits only
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/github/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "octocat",
  "repo": "Hello-World",
  "type": "commits",
  "limit": 5
}

###

### Ingest pull requests only
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/github/ingest
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "owner": "octocat",
  "repo": "Hello-World",
  "type": "pulls",
  "limit": 5,
  "state": "open"
}

